## 🔹 AWS IAM vs GCP IAM

| Feature                | AWS IAM                                                                 | GCP IAM                                                                 |
|-------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Scope                  | Global service                                                         | Project / resource scoped                                               |
| Entities               | Users, Groups, Roles, Policies                                          | Principals (users, service accounts), Roles, Policies                   |
| Role Types             | Roles assumed by services/users                                         | Primitive (Owner, Editor, Viewer), Predefined, Custom                   |
| Policy Format          | JSON with Allow/Deny + resource ARNs                                    | Bindings: Principal → Role → Resource                                   |
| Workload Identity      | Roles with temporary credentials                                        | Service accounts bound to workloads                                     |
| Tools                  | IAM Access Analyzer, CloudTrail                                         | Policy Troubleshooter, Audit Logs                                       |

