🔹 Best Practices
Use roles/service accounts instead of long‑lived keys

Apply principle of least privilege

Rotate credentials regularly

Monitor with IAM Access Analyzer (AWS) / Policy Troubleshooter (GCP)

Prefer managed policies for consistency, use custom policies only when necessary

